#!/usr/bin/env node
// FAIL-CLOSED GUARD: the external release identity is generated by the unified builder.
//
// In the unified RC3 candidate the release identity (RELEASE_MANIFEST.json, the archive
// sidecar and the release-level SHA256SUMS.txt) is generated deterministically by
// `tools/build_unified_release.ps1` into RELEASE_ASSETS_CANDIDATE, next to the archive.
